(()=>{"use strict";
const dictionaries={"es":{"Skip to content":"Ir al contenido","Jonathan Pincher":"Jonathan Pincher","Instructional & learning designer":"Diseñador instruccional y de aprendizaje","Home":"Inicio","My experience":"Mi experiencia","Accredited course design":"Diseño de cursos acreditados","Portfolio menu":"Menú del portafolio","Explore the portfolio":"Explora el portafolio","See the work":"Ver el trabajo","My approach":"Mi enfoque","Question":"Pregunta","Design":"Diseño","Test and refine":"Probar y mejorar","Experience overview":"Resumen de experiencia","Learning delivery":"Impartición de formación","Audit and accountability":"Auditoría y rendición de cuentas","University institute":"Instituto universitario","Summary of my CV":"Resumen de mi CV","Explore ADDIE":"Explorar ADDIE","Email me":"Escríbeme","START HERE":"EMPIEZA AQUÍ","Try the learning experience. See how one investigation becomes two different learning journeys.":"Prueba la experiencia de aprendizaje. Descubre cómo una investigación se convierte en dos recorridos de aprendizaje diferentes.","Explore my approach":"Explorar mi enfoque","See how I identify the need, design the experience and test the decisions.":"Descubre cómo identifico la necesidad, diseño la experiencia y pongo a prueba las decisiones.","See my experience":"Ver mi experiencia","Explore 30+ years of learning delivery, leadership and accountable programme design.":"Explora más de 30 años de formación, liderazgo y diseño de programas con responsabilidad sobre los resultados.","Discuss a role, a learning challenge or a possible collaboration.":"Hablemos de un puesto, un reto de aprendizaje o una posible colaboración.","Back to home":"Volver al inicio","Return to the portfolio home page.":"Vuelve a la página principal del portafolio.","Career evidence /":"Evidencias de trayectoria /","FEFC":"FEFC","Curriculum that meets the standard. Evidence that stands up to audit.":"Un currículo que cumple los requisitos. Evidencias que resisten una auditoría.","The courses I delivered had to meet":"Los cursos que impartí debían cumplir los requisitos del","Further Education Funding Council":"Further Education Funding Council","requirements—both in the curriculum and in the records demonstrating how the provision was delivered.":", tanto en el currículo como en los registros que demostraban cómo se había impartido la formación.","Meet the curriculum requirements.":"Cumplir los requisitos curriculares.","At the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery, I personally designed and wrote courses that achieved":"En el Manchester Institute for Information Delivery diseñé y redacté personalmente cursos que obtuvieron la acreditación","accreditation. I translated employer and learner needs into structured curricula, with defined learning outcomes, delivery methods and assessments.":". Traduje las necesidades de empleadores y estudiantes en currículos estructurados, con resultados de aprendizaje, métodos de enseñanza y evaluaciones definidos.","My responsibility extended from course design to delivery: the curriculum had to meet the requirements for accredited, funded provision.":"Mi responsabilidad abarcaba desde el diseño hasta la impartición: el currículo debía cumplir los requisitos de una formación acreditada y financiada.","Make delivery auditable.":"Hacer auditable la impartición.","I maintained detailed, provable records of learner support time and outcomes, alongside accreditation evidence, programme records and formal":"Mantuve registros detallados y verificables del tiempo de apoyo al alumnado y de los resultados, junto con evidencias de acreditación, registros de programas e informes formales para el","reporting. The evidence had to demonstrate how the funded learning provision was delivered.":". Las evidencias debían demostrar cómo se había impartido la formación financiada.","Annual FEFC and European Social Fund audits examined that provision. My CV records that these audits were passed without problems.":"Las auditorías anuales del FEFC y del Fondo Social Europeo examinaban esa formación. Mi CV recoge que se superaron sin problemas.","Take responsibility for both.":"Asumir la responsabilidad de ambos aspectos.","I brought curriculum design, programme delivery and evidence-based reporting together. That meant designing courses to the required standard and maintaining the records needed to account for their delivery.":"Integré diseño curricular, impartición e informes basados en evidencias. Eso suponía diseñar cursos conforme a los requisitos y mantener los registros necesarios para justificar su ejecución.","Experience from my role as Founder and Director, Manchester Institute for Information Delivery, Manchester Metropolitan University, 1996–2007. Drawn from my CV.":"Experiencia como fundador y director del Manchester Institute for Information Delivery, Manchester Metropolitan University, 1996–2007. Información extraída de mi CV.","30+ years":"Más de 30 años","6,000 learners":"6.000 estudiantes","Back to the homepage":"Volver a la página principal","ADDIE — how I examine the design process.":"ADDIE: cómo examino el proceso de diseño.","Analyse. Design. Develop. Implement. Evaluate.":"Analizar. Diseñar. Desarrollar. Implementar. Evaluar.","ADDIE stands for":"ADDIE significa","Analyse, Design, Develop, Implement and Evaluate":"Analizar, Diseñar, Desarrollar, Implementar y Evaluar",". It gives us a useful way to explain the work behind an experience. I am using it here to make the process inspectable, rather than claim that every stage has been completed in this sketch.":". Es una forma útil de explicar el trabajo que hay detrás de una experiencia. Aquí lo utilizo para hacer visible el proceso, no para afirmar que este prototipo haya completado todas sus etapas.","I would not treat the stages as a one-way production line. A prototype may reveal that the analysis was incomplete; feedback may send me back to a design decision. My test, test, test approach belongs throughout the work.":"No considero las etapas una cadena de producción en una sola dirección. Un prototipo puede revelar un análisis incompleto; la retroalimentación puede llevarme a revisar una decisión. Mi enfoque de probar, probar y volver a probar está presente en todo el proceso.","Select a stage or its arrow to see how I approached it in this project. Select it again to close it. You can open several stages at once.":"Selecciona una etapa o su símbolo para ver cómo la abordé en este proyecto. Vuelve a seleccionarla para cerrarla. Puedes abrir varias etapas a la vez.","Analyse — understand the need before choosing the solution":"Analizar: comprender la necesidad antes de elegir la solución","I started with a fictional need and two recognisable student groups, then considered the learner, tutor and institutional perspectives. That creates a basis for the two pathways. It does not replace discovery with a real commissioner: prior knowledge, barriers, delivery constraints and success criteria would need confirming with the people involved.":"Partí de una necesidad ficticia y de dos grupos de estudiantes reconocibles, y después consideré las perspectivas del alumnado, del docente y de la institución. Eso fundamenta los dos recorridos. No sustituye el trabajo de descubrimiento con un cliente real: habría que confirmar los conocimientos previos, las barreras, las condiciones de impartición y los criterios de éxito con las personas implicadas.","Design — decide how the experience should work":"Diseñar: decidir cómo debe funcionar la experiencia","I organised the routes, resources and supporting explanation, and considered how visitors would predict, investigate and interpret a result. I connect those choices to outcomes, activities and assessment, and make the reasoning visible through the":"Organicé los recorridos, los recursos y las explicaciones de apoyo, y consideré cómo las personas predecirían, investigarían e interpretarían un resultado. Relaciono esas decisiones con los resultados, las actividades y la evaluación, y hago visible el razonamiento en la","design account":"explicación del diseño","Develop — build enough to test the decisions":"Desarrollar: construir lo suficiente para probar las decisiones","I developed working pages, the model, the supporting resources and recorded introductions. Building exposed problems that a written plan alone would not reveal: disappearing geometry, unstable layout and language-dependent navigation. Revising those details is part of development, not simply tidying up after it.":"Desarrollé páginas funcionales, el modelo, recursos de apoyo e introducciones grabadas. La construcción reveló problemas que un plan escrito no habría mostrado: geometría que desaparecía, diseños inestables y navegación dependiente del idioma. Revisar esos detalles forma parte del desarrollo, no es solo un retoque final.","Implement — put it into its intended setting":"Implementar: llevarlo a su contexto de uso","The prototype can be explored, but it has not been implemented as a course within an institution. A real implementation would include an agreed delivery environment, tutor preparation, learner support, access arrangements and ownership of updates. Making a file available is not the same as making a learning experience work in practice.":"El prototipo se puede explorar, pero no se ha implantado como curso en una institución. Una implementación real incluiría un entorno de impartición acordado, preparación docente, apoyo al alumnado, condiciones de acceso y responsabilidad sobre las actualizaciones. Publicar un archivo no equivale a hacer que una experiencia de aprendizaje funcione en la práctica.","Evaluate — find out what works and what needs to change":"Evaluar: descubrir qué funciona y qué debe cambiar","Owner reviews and implementation checks have informed this sketch. Independent usability work, learner outcomes, stakeholder feedback and evidence from use in an institution remain to be gathered. I would use those findings to revisit earlier decisions, keeping the successful parts while investigating the sticking points.":"Las revisiones del responsable y las comprobaciones de implementación han orientado este prototipo. Aún faltan pruebas independientes de usabilidad, resultados de aprendizaje, opiniones de las partes interesadas y evidencias de uso institucional. Utilizaría esos hallazgos para revisar decisiones anteriores, conservar lo que funciona e investigar las dificultades.","The useful connection:":"La conexión útil:","ADDIE describes stages of work; design criteria help me question decisions within that work; observation and feedback help me judge the result. None of those should be mistaken for proof that this prototype has succeeded with its intended audiences.":"ADDIE describe etapas de trabajo; los criterios de diseño ayudan a cuestionar las decisiones en esas etapas; la observación y la retroalimentación permiten juzgar el resultado. Nada de ello debe confundirse con una prueba de éxito del prototipo con sus públicos previstos.","Explore the design":"Explorar el diseño","How I test and refine":"Cómo pruebo y mejoro","Jonathan Pincher · Learning design grounded in delivery":"Jonathan Pincher · Diseño del aprendizaje basado en la práctica","Explore my portfolio":"Explora mi portafolio","A clear need. A purposeful experience.":"Una necesidad clara. Una experiencia con propósito.","Three steps connect the question to something people can use.":"Tres pasos conectan la pregunta con algo que las personas pueden utilizar.","01 · Question":"01 · Pregunta","Understand the learner, the context and what needs to change before choosing the solution.":"Comprender al estudiante, el contexto y lo que debe cambiar antes de elegir la solución.","How I frame the problem":"Cómo planteo el problema","02 · Design":"02 · Diseño","Connect outcomes, activities, support and assessment. Make the reasoning visible.":"Conectar resultados, actividades, apoyo y evaluación. Hacer visible el razonamiento.","How I design the experience":"Cómo diseño la experiencia","03 · Test":"03 · Prueba","Observe what happens when people use the experience, question the result and refine the work.":"Observar qué ocurre cuando las personas utilizan la experiencia, cuestionar el resultado y mejorar el trabajo.","How I test and improve":"Cómo pruebo y mejoro","Career evidence / Audit and accountability":"Evidencias de trayectoria / Auditoría y rendición de cuentas","Deliver the learning. Account for the funding.":"Impartir la formación. Justificar la financiación.","My CV describes responsibility for the records, reporting and evidence behind publicly funded learning—not just the courses themselves.":"Mi CV describe la responsabilidad sobre los registros, informes y evidencias que respaldan la formación financiada con fondos públicos, no solo sobre los cursos.","University institute: evidence behind delivery.":"Instituto universitario: evidencias de la impartición.","As Founder and Director of the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery at Manchester Metropolitan University (1996–2007), I managed detailed, evidence-based reporting covering learner support time and outcomes.":"Como fundador y director del Manchester Institute for Information Delivery de Manchester Metropolitan University (1996–2007), gestioné informes detallados basados en evidencias sobre el tiempo de apoyo al alumnado y sus resultados.","I maintained provable records for annual FEFC and European Social Fund audits. My Training and Learning Manager CV states:":"Mantuve registros verificables para las auditorías anuales del FEFC y del Fondo Social Europeo. Mi CV de responsable de formación y aprendizaje indica:","“Maintained provable records and passed annual FEFC and European Social Fund audits without problems.”":"«Mantuve registros verificables y superé sin problemas las auditorías anuales del FEFC y del Fondo Social Europeo».","Skillkit: build reporting into the system.":"Skillkit: integrar los informes en el sistema.","As Founder and Managing Director of Skillkit Ltd (1997–2014), I designed online learning delivery and back-office systems for enquiries, learner records, monitoring and audit-ready reporting to UK and European government bodies.":"Como fundador y director general de Skillkit Ltd (1997–2014), diseñé la impartición de formación en línea y sistemas administrativos para consultas, registros del alumnado, seguimiento e informes preparados para auditorías de organismos públicos británicos y europeos.","These systems brought learner support and accurate records together, producing evidence for government audits alongside the day-to-day delivery of online skills programmes.":"Estos sistemas integraban el apoyo al alumnado y los registros precisos, generando evidencias para las auditorías públicas junto con la impartición diaria de programas de competencias en línea.","What this demonstrates.":"Qué demuestra esta experiencia.","I connect curriculum and programme delivery with the evidence needed to account for funded provision. My experience covers learner records, support-time reporting, outcome reporting and the systems that make those records available for scrutiny.":"Relaciono el diseño curricular y la impartición con las evidencias necesarias para justificar la formación financiada. Mi experiencia abarca registros del alumnado, informes del tiempo de apoyo y de resultados, y sistemas que permiten examinar esos registros.","For a learning design role, that means considering how a programme will be delivered, monitored and evidenced from the outset.":"Para un puesto de diseño del aprendizaje, esto significa prever desde el principio cómo se impartirá, supervisará y documentará un programa.","Source: Jonathan Pincher — Training and Learning Manager CV; supported by the AI & Digital Learning CV. This page summarises my CV; it does not reproduce original audit reports or certificates.":"Fuente: Jonathan Pincher — CV de responsable de formación y aprendizaje, respaldado por el CV de IA y aprendizaje digital. Esta página resume mi CV; no reproduce informes de auditoría ni certificados originales.","Curriculum and FEFC requirements":"Currículo y requisitos del FEFC","The university institute":"El instituto universitario","Experience with substance.":"Experiencia con fundamento.","Learning design, programme leadership and the responsibility to make delivery work.":"Diseño del aprendizaje, liderazgo de programas y responsabilidad para que la impartición funcione.","30+ years in learning and delivery.":"Más de 30 años en formación e impartición.","From founding SET in 1995 to leading online education at Skillkit and supporting organisational change through consultancy.":"Desde fundar SET en 1995 hasta dirigir la educación en línea en Skillkit y apoyar el cambio organizativo mediante consultoría.","Explore my career":"Explorar mi trayectoria","Approximately 6,000 learners annually.":"Aproximadamente 6.000 estudiantes al año.","I founded and directed a university institute, bringing course design, people and programme delivery together.":"Fundé y dirigí un instituto universitario, integrando diseño de cursos, equipos e impartición de programas.","Explore the institute":"Explorar el instituto","Curriculum standards. Audit evidence.":"Estándares curriculares. Evidencias de auditoría.","Courses had to meet FEFC requirements, supported by detailed records of delivery and learner support.":"Los cursos debían cumplir los requisitos del FEFC, con registros detallados de impartición y apoyo al alumnado.","Explore curriculum and accountability":"Explorar currículo y rendición de cuentas","The experience behind the work.":"La experiencia detrás del trabajo.","Jonathan Pincher · Learning experience design, digital learning and programme leadership":"Jonathan Pincher · Diseño de experiencias de aprendizaje, aprendizaje digital y liderazgo de programas","I turn organisational and learner needs into practical online and blended learning. My experience brings together course design, assessment, stakeholder consultancy and the leadership needed to deliver learning at scale. I have founded education businesses, led university-based provision and personally designed courses that achieved FEFC accreditation.":"Transformo las necesidades de organizaciones y estudiantes en aprendizaje práctico en línea y combinado. Mi experiencia reúne diseño de cursos, evaluación, consultoría con las partes interesadas y liderazgo para impartir formación a gran escala. He fundado empresas educativas, dirigido formación universitaria y diseñado personalmente cursos que obtuvieron acreditación del FEFC.","Evidence of delivery.":"Evidencias de impartición.","Approximately 6,000 learners annually:":"Aproximadamente 6.000 estudiantes al año:","built and led the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery at Manchester Metropolitan University, taking provision from course design through delivery.":"creé y dirigí el Manchester Institute for Information Delivery en Manchester Metropolitan University, desde el diseño de los cursos hasta su impartición.","Approximately £1 million annual revenue:":"Aproximadamente un millón de libras de ingresos anuales:","built Skillkit Ltd from inception into a business delivering online education and skills programmes.":"creé Skillkit Ltd desde cero hasta convertirla en una empresa de educación en línea y programas de competencias.","Personally designed, accredited courses:":"Cursos acreditados de diseño propio:","secured formal Further Education Funding Council accreditation for courses I designed and wrote, enabling access to FEFC funding.":"conseguí la acreditación formal del Further Education Funding Council para cursos que diseñé y redacté, lo que permitió acceder a financiación del FEFC.","International collaboration:":"Colaboración internacional:","established education and skills-development partnerships across the UK, Spain, Finland and China.":"establecí alianzas educativas y de desarrollo de competencias en el Reino Unido, España, Finlandia y China.","What I bring to a learning team.":"Qué aporto a un equipo de aprendizaje.","Design grounded in the need.":"Diseño basado en la necesidad.","I work with business leaders, educators and technical specialists to identify capability gaps, define learning outcomes and build curricula, delivery approaches and assessments around them.":"Colaboro con responsables empresariales, docentes y especialistas técnicos para identificar carencias de competencias, definir resultados de aprendizaje y construir currículos, métodos de impartición y evaluaciones en torno a ellos.","Experience across the learning cycle.":"Experiencia en todo el ciclo de aprendizaje.","At Skillkit, I managed work from needs analysis and design through LMS/VLE delivery and evaluation. Learner feedback, progress monitoring and performance information informed refinements to content and learner support.":"En Skillkit gestioné desde el análisis de necesidades y el diseño hasta la impartición mediante LMS/VLE y la evaluación. Las opiniones del alumnado, el seguimiento del progreso y la información de rendimiento orientaron las mejoras de contenido y apoyo.","Leadership alongside hands-on design.":"Liderazgo junto al diseño práctico.","I have trained and mentored staff, developed people for greater responsibility and brought academic, technical and operational teams together to deliver multidisciplinary programmes.":"He formado y orientado a profesionales, preparado a personas para asumir mayores responsabilidades y reunido equipos académicos, técnicos y operativos para impartir programas multidisciplinares.","Accountability for delivery.":"Responsabilidad sobre la impartición.","My experience includes government contracts, European funding proposals, budgets, accreditation evidence and formal reporting. At Skillkit, I created client-management systems covering enquiries, learner support and accurate records, producing evidence for UK and European government audits.":"Mi experiencia incluye contratos públicos, propuestas de financiación europea, presupuestos, evidencias de acreditación e informes formales. En Skillkit creé sistemas de gestión de clientes para consultas, apoyo al alumnado y registros precisos, generando evidencias para auditorías públicas británicas y europeas.","Career experience.":"Experiencia profesional.","Silver Consulting LLC · Owner & Manager · 2014–2026":"Silver Consulting LLC · Propietario y gerente · 2014–2026","Partnered with senior executives to diagnose organisational needs and translate business objectives into recommendations and implementation plans. Identified capability gaps, coached managers and supported technology adoption, digital capability and process improvement.":"Colaboré con altos directivos para diagnosticar necesidades organizativas y traducir objetivos empresariales en recomendaciones y planes de implementación. Identifiqué carencias de competencias, orienté a responsables y apoyé la adopción tecnológica, la capacidad digital y la mejora de procesos.","Skillkit Ltd · Founder & Owner · 1997–2014":"Skillkit Ltd · Fundador y propietario · 1997–2014","Built an online education and skills business to approximately £1 million annual revenue. Established online and blended programmes, developed staff, coordinated digital learning projects and managed the practical requirements of funded delivery.":"Desarrollé una empresa de educación en línea y competencias hasta alcanzar aproximadamente un millón de libras de ingresos anuales. Establecí programas en línea y combinados, desarrollé al equipo, coordiné proyectos de aprendizaje digital y gestioné las exigencias prácticas de la formación financiada.","Manchester Institute for Information Delivery · Founder & Director · 1996–2007":"Manchester Institute for Information Delivery · Fundador y director · 1996–2007","Founded and led a university-based institute at Manchester Metropolitan University, recruiting and training approximately 6,000 learners annually. Designed accredited courses, maintained programme records and reporting, and developed international partnerships.":"Fundé y dirigí un instituto de Manchester Metropolitan University que captaba y formaba aproximadamente a 6.000 estudiantes al año. Diseñé cursos acreditados, mantuve registros e informes y desarrollé alianzas internacionales.","Innovation in Digital and Electronic Arts (IDEA) · Founding Chair · 1996–2007":"Innovation in Digital and Electronic Arts (IDEA) · Presidente fundador · 1996–2007","Helped establish a not-for-profit organisation whose education and digital-skills programmes trained thousands of participants across the North of England. Worked with education, industry and public-sector partners to develop accessible training for individuals and small businesses.":"Ayudé a crear una organización sin ánimo de lucro cuyos programas educativos y de competencias digitales formaron a miles de personas en el norte de Inglaterra. Colaboré con socios educativos, industriales y públicos para desarrollar formación accesible para personas y pequeñas empresas.","SET Ltd · Founder & Owner · 1995–1997":"SET Ltd · Fundador y propietario · 1995–1997","Established an online education company, developing learning content and coordinating programmes, resources, participant communication and digital delivery.":"Establecí una empresa de educación en línea, desarrollando contenidos y coordinando programas, recursos, comunicación con participantes e impartición digital.","British Telecom UK · Telecommunications Technician · 1982–1986":"British Telecom UK · Técnico de telecomunicaciones · 1982–1986","Installed digital telecommunications systems and managed small teams, building a practical foundation in fault-finding, technical problem-solving and service delivery.":"Instalé sistemas digitales de telecomunicaciones y dirigí pequeños equipos, desarrollando una base práctica en diagnóstico de fallos, resolución de problemas técnicos y prestación de servicios.","AI and automation in practice.":"IA y automatización en la práctica.","I use ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot and Notion AI to support research, learning design, content development and information analysis. Practical experience with Make and Zapier supports automation, productivity and process improvement. My interest is in responsible adoption: applying technology to the learning or operational need.":"Utilizo ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot y Notion AI para apoyar la investigación, el diseño del aprendizaje, el desarrollo de contenidos y el análisis de información. Mi experiencia práctica con Make y Zapier facilita la automatización, la productividad y la mejora de procesos. Me interesa una adopción responsable: aplicar la tecnología a la necesidad educativa u operativa.","The portfolio lets you explore my current design work alongside this career experience, including learning activities, teaching resources and the reasoning behind the design.":"El portafolio permite explorar mi trabajo de diseño actual junto con esta experiencia profesional, incluidas actividades, recursos docentes y el razonamiento detrás del diseño.","Education and working arrangements.":"Formación y modalidades de trabajo.","Manchester Metropolitan University:":"Manchester Metropolitan University:","First-Class Honours Degree in InterActive Arts, specialising in Information Delivery.":"Grado con honores de primera clase en InterActive Arts, con especialización en Information Delivery.","Reading Polytechnic:":"Reading Polytechnic:","Higher National Diploma in Electrical Engineering, Telecommunications.":"Higher National Diploma en Ingeniería Eléctrica, Telecomunicaciones.","Based in Spain, planning relocation to Manchester and available for remote working.":"Resido en España, planeo trasladarme a Manchester y tengo disponibilidad para trabajar a distancia.","02 / Design":"02 / Diseño","Turn “what if?” into “try this”.":"Convertir «¿y si…?» en «prueba esto».","Give the learner something to predict, investigate and explain. Then make the design decisions visible so the experience can be questioned and improved.":"Ofrecer al estudiante algo que predecir, investigar y explicar. Después, hacer visibles las decisiones de diseño para poder cuestionar y mejorar la experiencia.","Design backwards from the outcome.":"Diseñar a partir del resultado deseado.","I connect the intended outcome to an activity, the support learners need and the evidence that will show understanding. I use":"Relaciono el resultado previsto con una actividad, el apoyo necesario y las evidencias que demostrarán comprensión. Utilizo","ADDIE":"ADDIE","to structure the work while leaving room to revise decisions.":"para estructurar el trabajo, dejando espacio para revisar decisiones.","From “watch this” to “try this”.":"De «mira esto» a «prueba esto».","The":"La","stick investigation":"investigación con una vara","moves from prediction to observation and explanation. The":"avanza desde la predicción hasta la observación y la explicación. El","university pathway":"recorrido universitario","adds a model whose assumptions can be questioned. The learning task makes the reasoning visible, rather than hiding it behind a finished answer.":"añade un modelo cuyas suposiciones pueden cuestionarse. La tarea hace visible el razonamiento en lugar de ocultarlo tras una respuesta final.","Build something people can challenge.":"Construir algo que se pueda cuestionar.","I use AI-supported prototyping to make ideas tangible. My role is to shape the learning, question the output and refine the experience. That builds on experience designing":"Utilizo prototipos apoyados por IA para concretar ideas. Mi papel es dar forma al aprendizaje, cuestionar los resultados y mejorar la experiencia. Esto se apoya en mi experiencia diseñando cursos acreditados por el","-accredited courses and delivering online and blended programmes through Skillkit.":"e impartiendo programas en línea y combinados a través de Skillkit.","Explore the design decisions":"Explorar las decisiones de diseño","Test":"Prueba","02 / Explore the design":"02 / Explorar el diseño","Next: see the design in action":"Siguiente: ver el diseño en acción","Career evidence / 30+ years":"Evidencias de trayectoria / Más de 30 años","Learning design. Built on delivery.":"Diseño del aprendizaje basado en la práctica.","From founding an education business in 1995 to developing interactive learning today, I connect course design with the realities of running programmes.":"Desde fundar una empresa educativa en 1995 hasta desarrollar aprendizaje interactivo hoy, conecto el diseño de cursos con la realidad de gestionar programas.","1995–1997 · SET Ltd":"1995–1997 · SET Ltd","I established an online education company, developing learning content and coordinating programmes, resources and digital delivery. I managed participant communication, administration, finances and operations alongside the learning itself.":"Establecí una empresa de educación en línea, desarrollando contenidos y coordinando programas, recursos e impartición digital. También gestioné la comunicación con participantes, la administración, las finanzas y las operaciones.","1996–2007 · Manchester Metropolitan University":"1996–2007 · Manchester Metropolitan University","I founded and directed the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery. I translated employer and learner needs into courses with defined outcomes, curricula and assessments, and secured":"Fundé y dirigí el Manchester Institute for Information Delivery. Traduje las necesidades de empleadores y estudiantes en cursos con resultados, currículos y evaluaciones definidos, y conseguí la acreditación","accreditation for courses I personally designed.":"para cursos que diseñé personalmente.","1997–2014 · Skillkit Ltd":"1997–2014 · Skillkit Ltd","I built an online education and skills business to approximately £1 million in annual revenue. My work covered needs analysis, design, delivery and evaluation, supported by learner feedback, progress monitoring and learning management systems.":"Desarrollé una empresa de educación en línea y competencias hasta alcanzar aproximadamente un millón de libras de ingresos anuales. Mi trabajo abarcó análisis de necesidades, diseño, impartición y evaluación, con apoyo de opiniones del alumnado, seguimiento del progreso y sistemas de gestión del aprendizaje.","2014–2026 · Silver Consulting LLC":"2014–2026 · Silver Consulting LLC","I worked with senior executives to diagnose organisational needs, identify capability gaps and turn priorities into practical plans. I supported technology adoption, management development and process improvement.":"Trabajé con altos directivos para diagnosticar necesidades organizativas, identificar carencias de competencias y convertir prioridades en planes prácticos. Apoyé la adopción tecnológica, el desarrollo directivo y la mejora de procesos.","What that brings to learning design":"Qué aporta esto al diseño del aprendizaje","I consider the whole journey: the learner’s starting point, the intended outcome, the activity, the assessment and the support needed to put learning into practice. Today, I also use AI and automation to support research, content development and prototyping.":"Considero el recorrido completo: el punto de partida del estudiante, el resultado previsto, la actividad, la evaluación y el apoyo para aplicar lo aprendido. Hoy también utilizo IA y automatización para apoyar investigación, desarrollo de contenidos y prototipos.","Drawn from my Training and Learning Manager CV and AI & Digital Learning CV.":"Información extraída de mis CV de responsable de formación y aprendizaje y de IA y aprendizaje digital.","FEFC accreditation":"Acreditación del FEFC","You can go directly to the learning project using the button below, or read the project overview that follows below.":"Puedes acceder directamente al proyecto de aprendizaje con el botón siguiente o leer la descripción que aparece a continuación.","Open the interactive project":"Abrir el proyecto interactivo","One investigation. Two learning journeys.":"Una investigación. Dos recorridos de aprendizaje.","A stick is a simple starting point. What learners do with it reveals the design.":"Una vara es un punto de partida sencillo. Lo que los estudiantes hacen con ella revela el diseño.","Explore the learning. Examine the thinking behind it.":"Explora el aprendizaje. Examina las ideas que lo sustentan.","How do you turn an everyday object into a worthwhile learning experience? This project starts with a stick and develops two distinct learning pathways: one for 15-year-old school learners, the other for first-year undergraduates. I’ve brought together the lessons, interactive activities, teaching resources and design reasoning so you can explore both the learner experience and the decisions that shape it.":"¿Cómo convertir un objeto cotidiano en una experiencia de aprendizaje valiosa? Este proyecto parte de una vara y desarrolla dos recorridos diferentes: uno para estudiantes de 15 años y otro para alumnado universitario de primer curso. He reunido clases, actividades interactivas, recursos docentes y razonamientos de diseño para explorar tanto la experiencia del estudiante como las decisiones que la configuran.","Two audiences. Purposeful differences.":"Dos públicos. Diferencias con propósito.","The school pathway builds from observation and comparison to prediction, practical investigation and evaluation across four 60-minute lessons. The undergraduate pathway develops modelling, experimental design, measurement, uncertainty and critical analysis across four two-hour sessions. The comparison explains why the curriculum, level of challenge, support and assessment change for each audience.":"El recorrido escolar avanza desde la observación y la comparación hasta la predicción, la investigación práctica y la evaluación en cuatro clases de 60 minutos. El recorrido universitario desarrolla modelización, diseño experimental, medición, incertidumbre y análisis crítico en cuatro sesiones de dos horas. La comparación explica por qué cambian el currículo, la dificultad, el apoyo y la evaluación para cada público.","Learning you can explore for yourself.":"Aprendizaje que puedes explorar por ti mismo.","Interactive demonstrations and activities invite learners to investigate, test ideas and explain their reasoning. Move between the two pathways to see how the same starting point can lead to different questions, tasks and expectations—and how the interface supports each group.":"Las demostraciones y actividades interactivas invitan a investigar, probar ideas y explicar el razonamiento. Alterna los recorridos para ver cómo un mismo punto de partida conduce a preguntas, tareas y expectativas distintas, y cómo la interfaz apoya a cada grupo.","Resources for the teacher as well as the learner.":"Recursos para docentes y estudiantes.","Detailed teacher packs bring together lesson plans, learning objectives, preparation guidance, worksheets, practical tasks, assessment criteria, model answers and marking rubrics. A teacher dashboard, automatic filling and marking options demonstrate how the product can support the practical work of delivery and assessment alongside the learning activities.":"Los materiales docentes reúnen planes de clase, objetivos, preparación, hojas de trabajo, tareas prácticas, criterios de evaluación, respuestas modelo y rúbricas. Un panel docente y opciones de cumplimentación y corrección automáticas muestran cómo el producto puede apoyar la impartición y la evaluación junto con las actividades.","The reasoning behind the experience.":"El razonamiento detrás de la experiencia.","Explore how I connect curriculum outcomes with activities and evidence of learning, apply ADDIE to examine the design process, and approach differentiation, navigation and accessibility. English, Spanish and Chinese content and speaking guides show how language and presentation form part of the experience. The project also explains where AI supports development and teaching, and where professional judgement remains essential.":"Explora cómo relaciono resultados curriculares con actividades y evidencias de aprendizaje, aplico ADDIE para examinar el proceso y abordo diferenciación, navegación y accesibilidad. El contenido y las guías habladas en inglés, español y chino muestran cómo el idioma y la presentación forman parte de la experiencia. El proyecto también explica dónde apoya la IA y dónde sigue siendo imprescindible el criterio profesional.","Together, these elements offer a practical view of what I create, why I make particular decisions and how I develop them into a coherent learning product. Start with an activity, inspect a teaching pack or follow the design rationale—the project lets you examine the work from the perspective that interests you most.":"Estos elementos ofrecen una visión práctica de lo que creo, por qué tomo determinadas decisiones y cómo las convierto en un producto de aprendizaje coherente. Empieza por una actividad, examina un material docente o sigue el razonamiento de diseño: puedes explorar el trabajo desde la perspectiva que más te interese.","For people hiring learning designers":"Para quienes contratan diseñadores de aprendizaje","Don’t just":"No te limites a","read my CV.":"leer mi CV.","Put my thinking":"Pon mis ideas","to work.":"en práctica.","I’m Jonathan Pincher. I bring":"Soy Jonathan Pincher. Aporto","30+ years of experience":"más de 30 años de experiencia","turning learner needs into clear courses, practical activities and meaningful assessment—online and blended.":"transformando las necesidades del alumnado en cursos claros, actividades prácticas y evaluaciones significativas, en línea y combinadas.","what if?":"¿y si…?","EXPLORE THE DESIGN":"EXPLORA EL DISEÑO","ASK A BETTER QUESTION":"PLANTEA UNA MEJOR PREGUNTA","TRY THE EXPERIENCE":"PRUEBA LA EXPERIENCIA","EXPLORE ADDIE":"EXPLORA ADDIE","DESIGN THE EXPERIENCE":"DISEÑA LA EXPERIENCIA","TEST AND REFINE":"PRUEBA Y MEJORA","01 / Question":"01 / Pregunta","What if the same lesson needs two different designs?":"¿Y si la misma clase necesita dos diseños diferentes?","A stick. Two learners. Two different starting points. The question is not what content to show—it is what each learner needs to understand and do.":"Una vara. Dos estudiantes. Dos puntos de partida. La cuestión no es qué contenido mostrar, sino qué necesita comprender y hacer cada estudiante.","Find the real problem.":"Encontrar el problema real.","I begin with learners, employers and the context in which learning will be used. I define the required change before choosing content, a platform or an activity.":"Empiezo por estudiantes, empleadores y el contexto en el que se utilizará el aprendizaje. Defino el cambio necesario antes de elegir contenidos, plataforma o actividad.","One stick. Two very different challenges.":"Una vara. Dos retos muy distintos.","In my learning portfolio, a 15-year-old learner observes, predicts and explains. A first-year university learner models, analyses and questions assumptions. The material stays the same; the task changes because the learning need changes.":"En mi portafolio de aprendizaje, un estudiante de 15 años observa, predice y explica. Un universitario de primer curso modeliza, analiza y cuestiona supuestos. El material no cambia; la tarea sí, porque cambia la necesidad de aprendizaje.","Experience behind the approach.":"La experiencia detrás del enfoque.","At Manchester Metropolitan University, I translated employer and learner needs into courses with defined outcomes, curricula and assessments. The institute I founded recruited and trained approximately 6,000 learners annually.":"En Manchester Metropolitan University traduje las necesidades de empleadores y estudiantes en cursos con resultados, currículos y evaluaciones definidos. El instituto que fundé captaba y formaba aproximadamente a 6.000 estudiantes al año.","Compare the two learning journeys":"Comparar los dos recorridos de aprendizaje","01 / Ask a better question":"01 / Plantear una mejor pregunta","Next: turn the question into a design":"Siguiente: convertir la pregunta en un diseño","03 / Test":"03 / Prueba","A polished screen is only the start.":"Una pantalla cuidada es solo el comienzo.","The useful question is what happens when somebody tries to learn with it.":"La pregunta útil es qué ocurre cuando alguien intenta aprender con ella.","Test the task. Then question the result.":"Probar la tarea. Después, cuestionar el resultado.","I look at whether instructions make sense, choices lead somewhere useful and feedback helps the learner decide what to do next. A working button proves the interaction works; it does not establish that learning has happened.":"Examino si las instrucciones se entienden, las opciones llevan a algo útil y la retroalimentación ayuda a decidir el siguiente paso. Que un botón funcione demuestra que la interacción funciona, no que se haya aprendido.","Look for the reasoning, not just the answer.":"Buscar el razonamiento, no solo la respuesta.","In the stick investigation, prediction and explanation offer something to compare. In the university pathway, questioning the model reveals assumptions. These activities create opportunities to examine understanding; their educational impact still needs evaluation with learners.":"En la investigación con una vara, la predicción y la explicación permiten comparar. En el recorrido universitario, cuestionar el modelo revela sus supuestos. Estas actividades permiten examinar la comprensión; su impacto educativo aún debe evaluarse con estudiantes.","Use evidence to improve delivery.":"Utilizar evidencias para mejorar la impartición.","At Skillkit, I used learner feedback, progress monitoring and programme information to refine content and learner support. At the university institute, I maintained evidence-based reporting and records for":"En Skillkit utilicé opiniones del alumnado, seguimiento del progreso e información del programa para mejorar contenidos y apoyo. En el instituto universitario mantuve informes basados en evidencias y registros para auditorías del","and European Social Fund audits. That same discipline informs how I approach this prototype.":"y del Fondo Social Europeo. Esa misma disciplina orienta mi enfoque de este prototipo.","Explore reflection in the portfolio":"Explorar la reflexión en el portafolio","Career evidence / 6,000":"Evidencias de trayectoria / 6.000","Learning at scale. Designed around people.":"Aprendizaje a gran escala, diseñado para las personas.","At Manchester Metropolitan University, I founded an institute recruiting and training approximately 6,000 learners annually.":"En Manchester Metropolitan University fundé un instituto que captaba y formaba aproximadamente a 6.000 estudiantes al año.","Build the provision. Lead the delivery.":"Crear la formación. Dirigir su impartición.","As Founder and Director of the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery from 1996 to 2007, I took provision from course design through delivery. I coordinated academic, technical and operational teams, alongside external partners and funding organisations.":"Como fundador y director del Manchester Institute for Information Delivery entre 1996 y 2007, asumí desde el diseño de cursos hasta su impartición. Coordiné equipos académicos, técnicos y operativos, además de socios externos y entidades financiadoras.","Grow the capacity to deliver":"Ampliar la capacidad de impartición","I grew the department from 2 to 20 employees and annual income from £0 to £600,000. Recruiting, training and mentoring staff helped build the capacity to support programme delivery.":"Amplié el departamento de 2 a 20 empleados y los ingresos anuales de 0 a 600.000 libras. La contratación, formación y orientación del personal ayudó a crear la capacidad necesaria para impartir los programas.","Make the learning accountable":"Hacer el aprendizaje responsable y verificable","I assessed programme requirements and translated them into structured courses and delivery plans. I maintained detailed records of learner support time and outcomes, with evidence-based reporting for":"Evalué los requisitos de los programas y los traduje en cursos y planes de impartición estructurados. Mantuve registros detallados del tiempo de apoyo y los resultados del alumnado, con informes basados en evidencias para auditorías del","and European Social Fund audits.":"y del Fondo Social Europeo.","Work across boundaries":"Colaborar más allá de las fronteras","I established partnerships across the UK, Spain, Finland and China, bringing educators, technical specialists and partners together around education and skills development.":"Establecí alianzas en el Reino Unido, España, Finlandia y China, reuniendo a educadores, especialistas técnicos y socios en torno a la educación y al desarrollo de competencias.","What the figure means":"Qué significa la cifra","The approximately 6,000 figure describes annual learner recruitment and training at the institute during my leadership. It is a measure of provision, rather than a claim about completion rates or measured learning gains.":"La cifra aproximada de 6.000 corresponde a la captación y formación anual de estudiantes durante mi dirección del instituto. Mide el volumen de formación, no tasas de finalización ni mejoras de aprendizaje demostradas.","Breadcrumb":"Ruta de navegación","Career evidence":"Evidencias de trayectoria","Continue exploring":"Seguir explorando","Explore the ADDIE framework":"Explorar el marco ADDIE","FEFC archived homepage":"Página archivada del FEFC","From a question to a learning experience":"De una pregunta a una experiencia de aprendizaje","Main portfolio navigation":"Navegación principal del portafolio","Portfolio navigation":"Navegación del portafolio","Read how I design learning experiences":"Lee cómo diseño experiencias de aprendizaje","Read how I test and refine the work":"Lee cómo pruebo y mejoro el trabajo","Related career evidence":"Evidencias de trayectoria relacionadas","What if? Turn the question into a learning experience":"¿Y si…? Convierte la pregunta en una experiencia de aprendizaje","Choose language":"Elegir idioma","Put my thinking to work | Jonathan Pincher":"Ponga mis ideas en acción | Jonathan Pincher","Jonathan Pincher: instructional design, working learning experiences and evidence from 30+ years of delivery.":"Jonathan Pincher: diseño instruccional, experiencias de aprendizaje prácticas y evidencias de más de 30 años de trabajo."},"zh":{"Skip to content":"跳转到内容","Jonathan Pincher":"Jonathan Pincher","Instructional & learning designer":"教学与学习设计师","Home":"首页","My experience":"我的经验","Accredited course design":"认证课程设计","Portfolio menu":"作品集菜单","Explore the portfolio":"探索作品集","See the work":"查看作品","My approach":"我的方法","Question":"提问","Design":"设计","Test and refine":"测试与改进","Experience overview":"经验概览","Learning delivery":"教学实施","Audit and accountability":"审计与责任落实","University institute":"大学研究与培训机构","Summary of my CV":"我的简历摘要","Explore ADDIE":"探索 ADDIE","Email me":"联系我","START HERE":"从这里开始","Try the learning experience. See how one investigation becomes two different learning journeys.":"体验学习活动，了解同一项探究如何发展为两条不同的学习路径。","Explore my approach":"探索我的方法","See how I identify the need, design the experience and test the decisions.":"了解我如何识别需求、设计学习体验并验证设计决策。","See my experience":"查看我的经验","Explore 30+ years of learning delivery, leadership and accountable programme design.":"了解我三十余年来在教学实施、领导管理及负责任的课程项目设计方面的经验。","Discuss a role, a learning challenge or a possible collaboration.":"欢迎讨论工作机会、学习设计挑战或合作可能。","Back to home":"返回首页","Return to the portfolio home page.":"返回作品集首页。","Career evidence /":"职业经历实证 /","FEFC":"FEFC","Curriculum that meets the standard. Evidence that stands up to audit.":"符合标准的课程，经得起审计的证据。","The courses I delivered had to meet":"我所实施的课程必须符合","Further Education Funding Council":"继续教育资助委员会（Further Education Funding Council）","requirements—both in the curriculum and in the records demonstrating how the provision was delivered.":"的要求，既包括课程本身，也包括能够说明教学实施情况的记录。","Meet the curriculum requirements.":"满足课程标准。","At the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery, I personally designed and wrote courses that achieved":"在 Manchester Institute for Information Delivery，我亲自设计并编写了获得以下机构认证的课程：","accreditation. I translated employer and learner needs into structured curricula, with defined learning outcomes, delivery methods and assessments.":"。我将雇主与学习者的需求转化为结构化课程，明确学习成果、教学方法与评估方式。","My responsibility extended from course design to delivery: the curriculum had to meet the requirements for accredited, funded provision.":"我的职责涵盖课程设计到教学实施，课程必须满足获得认证与资助的要求。","Make delivery auditable.":"让教学实施可以审计。","I maintained detailed, provable records of learner support time and outcomes, alongside accreditation evidence, programme records and formal":"我保存了学习支持时间与结果的详细可核查记录，以及认证证据、课程项目记录和提交以下机构的正式报告：","reporting. The evidence had to demonstrate how the funded learning provision was delivered.":"。这些证据必须说明受资助的教学工作如何实施。","Annual FEFC and European Social Fund audits examined that provision. My CV records that these audits were passed without problems.":"FEFC 与欧洲社会基金每年对这些教学工作进行审计。我的简历记载，这些审计均顺利通过。","Take responsibility for both.":"对设计与实施共同负责。","I brought curriculum design, programme delivery and evidence-based reporting together. That meant designing courses to the required standard and maintaining the records needed to account for their delivery.":"我将课程设计、项目实施与基于证据的报告结合起来，既按标准设计课程，也保存说明实施情况所需的记录。","Experience from my role as Founder and Director, Manchester Institute for Information Delivery, Manchester Metropolitan University, 1996–2007. Drawn from my CV.":"依据本人简历：1996—2007 年任 Manchester Metropolitan University 下属 Manchester Institute for Information Delivery 创始人兼主任。","30+ years":"三十余年","6,000 learners":"6,000 名学习者","Back to the homepage":"返回首页","ADDIE — how I examine the design process.":"ADDIE：我如何审视设计过程。","Analyse. Design. Develop. Implement. Evaluate.":"分析、设计、开发、实施、评价。","ADDIE stands for":"ADDIE 代表","Analyse, Design, Develop, Implement and Evaluate":"分析、设计、开发、实施与评价",". It gives us a useful way to explain the work behind an experience. I am using it here to make the process inspectable, rather than claim that every stage has been completed in this sketch.":"。它有助于解释一项学习体验背后的工作。我在这里用它呈现可供审视的过程，而非声称这一原型已完成所有阶段。","I would not treat the stages as a one-way production line. A prototype may reveal that the analysis was incomplete; feedback may send me back to a design decision. My test, test, test approach belongs throughout the work.":"我不会把这些阶段视为单向生产线。原型可能暴露分析中的不足，反馈也可能促使我重新考虑设计决策。反复测试贯穿整个过程。","Select a stage or its arrow to see how I approached it in this project. Select it again to close it. You can open several stages at once.":"选择某一阶段或其符号，查看我在本项目中的做法；再次选择即可收起。可以同时展开多个阶段。","Analyse — understand the need before choosing the solution":"分析：先理解需求，再选择方案","I started with a fictional need and two recognisable student groups, then considered the learner, tutor and institutional perspectives. That creates a basis for the two pathways. It does not replace discovery with a real commissioner: prior knowledge, barriers, delivery constraints and success criteria would need confirming with the people involved.":"我从一个虚构需求和两个具有现实特征的学习群体出发，考虑学习者、教师与机构的视角，为两条学习路径奠定基础。这不能替代与真实委托方开展的需求调研：已有知识、学习障碍、实施条件与成功标准都需要与相关人员确认。","Design — decide how the experience should work":"设计：决定学习体验如何运作","I organised the routes, resources and supporting explanation, and considered how visitors would predict, investigate and interpret a result. I connect those choices to outcomes, activities and assessment, and make the reasoning visible through the":"我组织了学习路径、资源及辅助说明，并考虑访问者如何预测、探究和解释结果。我把这些选择与学习成果、活动及评估联系起来，并在以下内容中呈现设计理由：","design account":"设计说明","Develop — build enough to test the decisions":"开发：构建足以检验决策的内容","I developed working pages, the model, the supporting resources and recorded introductions. Building exposed problems that a written plan alone would not reveal: disappearing geometry, unstable layout and language-dependent navigation. Revising those details is part of development, not simply tidying up after it.":"我开发了可操作的页面、模型、辅助资源与录制的介绍。构建过程暴露出书面计划难以发现的问题：图形消失、布局不稳定，以及受语言影响的导航。修正这些细节是开发工作的一部分，而非最后的润色。","Implement — put it into its intended setting":"实施：将方案放入预期使用情境","The prototype can be explored, but it has not been implemented as a course within an institution. A real implementation would include an agreed delivery environment, tutor preparation, learner support, access arrangements and ownership of updates. Making a file available is not the same as making a learning experience work in practice.":"原型可以体验，但尚未作为机构中的正式课程实施。真正实施需要商定教学环境、教师准备、学习支持、访问安排以及更新责任。提供一个文件，并不等于让学习体验在实际情境中有效运作。","Evaluate — find out what works and what needs to change":"评价：了解哪些有效，哪些需要改变","Owner reviews and implementation checks have informed this sketch. Independent usability work, learner outcomes, stakeholder feedback and evidence from use in an institution remain to be gathered. I would use those findings to revisit earlier decisions, keeping the successful parts while investigating the sticking points.":"项目负责人的评审与实施检查推动了这一原型的改进。独立可用性研究、学习成果、相关方反馈和机构实际使用的证据仍有待收集。我会据此重新审视先前的决策，保留有效之处并调查困难所在。","The useful connection:":"有价值的联系：","ADDIE describes stages of work; design criteria help me question decisions within that work; observation and feedback help me judge the result. None of those should be mistaken for proof that this prototype has succeeded with its intended audiences.":"ADDIE 描述工作阶段，设计标准帮助我审视各阶段的决策，观察与反馈帮助我判断结果。这些都不应被视为原型已在目标群体中取得成功的证明。","Explore the design":"探索设计","How I test and refine":"我如何测试与改进","Jonathan Pincher · Learning design grounded in delivery":"Jonathan Pincher · 以教学实践为基础的学习设计","Explore my portfolio":"探索我的作品集","A clear need. A purposeful experience.":"明确的需求，有目的的体验。","Three steps connect the question to something people can use.":"三个步骤，把问题转化为人们可以使用的学习体验。","01 · Question":"01 · 提问","Understand the learner, the context and what needs to change before choosing the solution.":"选择解决方案之前，先理解学习者、情境及需要发生的改变。","How I frame the problem":"我如何界定问题","02 · Design":"02 · 设计","Connect outcomes, activities, support and assessment. Make the reasoning visible.":"连接学习成果、活动、支持与评估，让设计理由清晰可见。","How I design the experience":"我如何设计体验","03 · Test":"03 · 测试","Observe what happens when people use the experience, question the result and refine the work.":"观察人们使用学习体验时的情况，审视结果并改进作品。","How I test and improve":"我如何测试与改进","Career evidence / Audit and accountability":"职业经历实证 / 审计与责任落实","Deliver the learning. Account for the funding.":"实施教学，说明资金使用情况。","My CV describes responsibility for the records, reporting and evidence behind publicly funded learning—not just the courses themselves.":"我的简历不仅记载课程工作，还包括对公共资助教学所需记录、报告与证据承担的责任。","University institute: evidence behind delivery.":"大学机构：教学实施背后的证据。","As Founder and Director of the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery at Manchester Metropolitan University (1996–2007), I managed detailed, evidence-based reporting covering learner support time and outcomes.":"1996—2007 年担任 Manchester Metropolitan University 下属 Manchester Institute for Information Delivery 创始人兼主任期间，我管理了有关学习支持时间及结果的详细证据报告。","I maintained provable records for annual FEFC and European Social Fund audits. My Training and Learning Manager CV states:":"我为 FEFC 与欧洲社会基金的年度审计保存了可核查记录。我的培训与学习经理简历记载：","“Maintained provable records and passed annual FEFC and European Social Fund audits without problems.”":"“保存可核查记录，并顺利通过 FEFC 和欧洲社会基金的年度审计。”","Skillkit: build reporting into the system.":"Skillkit：将报告纳入系统。","As Founder and Managing Director of Skillkit Ltd (1997–2014), I designed online learning delivery and back-office systems for enquiries, learner records, monitoring and audit-ready reporting to UK and European government bodies.":"1997—2014 年担任 Skillkit Ltd 创始人兼总经理期间，我设计了在线教学与后台系统，处理咨询、学员记录、进度监测，以及面向英国和欧洲政府机构审计的报告。","These systems brought learner support and accurate records together, producing evidence for government audits alongside the day-to-day delivery of online skills programmes.":"这些系统将学习支持与准确记录结合起来，在日常在线技能教学过程中形成政府审计所需的证据。","What this demonstrates.":"这些经历说明了什么。","I connect curriculum and programme delivery with the evidence needed to account for funded provision. My experience covers learner records, support-time reporting, outcome reporting and the systems that make those records available for scrutiny.":"我将课程及项目实施与说明受资助教学所需的证据联系起来。经验涵盖学员记录、支持时间与结果报告，以及让这些记录可供核查的系统。","For a learning design role, that means considering how a programme will be delivered, monitored and evidenced from the outset.":"对于学习设计岗位，这意味着从一开始就考虑课程项目如何实施、监测和形成证据。","Source: Jonathan Pincher — Training and Learning Manager CV; supported by the AI & Digital Learning CV. This page summarises my CV; it does not reproduce original audit reports or certificates.":"来源：Jonathan Pincher 的培训与学习经理简历，并参考人工智能与数字学习简历。本页为简历摘要，不展示审计报告或证书原件。","Curriculum and FEFC requirements":"课程与 FEFC 要求","The university institute":"大学机构","Experience with substance.":"有实质支撑的经验。","Learning design, programme leadership and the responsibility to make delivery work.":"学习设计、课程项目领导，以及让教学顺利开展的责任。","30+ years in learning and delivery.":"三十余年的学习与教学实施经验。","From founding SET in 1995 to leading online education at Skillkit and supporting organisational change through consultancy.":"从 1995 年创立 SET，到在 Skillkit 领导在线教育，再到通过咨询支持组织变革。","Explore my career":"探索我的职业经历","Approximately 6,000 learners annually.":"每年约 6,000 名学习者。","I founded and directed a university institute, bringing course design, people and programme delivery together.":"我创办并领导了一家大学机构，将课程设计、人员协作与项目实施结合起来。","Explore the institute":"探索大学机构","Curriculum standards. Audit evidence.":"课程标准，审计证据。","Courses had to meet FEFC requirements, supported by detailed records of delivery and learner support.":"课程需要符合 FEFC 要求，并有详细的教学实施及学习支持记录。","Explore curriculum and accountability":"探索课程与责任落实","The experience behind the work.":"作品背后的经验。","Jonathan Pincher · Learning experience design, digital learning and programme leadership":"Jonathan Pincher · 学习体验设计、数字学习与课程项目领导","I turn organisational and learner needs into practical online and blended learning. My experience brings together course design, assessment, stakeholder consultancy and the leadership needed to deliver learning at scale. I have founded education businesses, led university-based provision and personally designed courses that achieved FEFC accreditation.":"我将组织与学习者的需求转化为实用的在线及混合式学习。我的经验结合课程设计、评估、相关方咨询，以及大规模实施教学所需的领导能力。我曾创办教育企业、领导大学教学项目，并亲自设计获得 FEFC 认证的课程。","Evidence of delivery.":"教学实施实证。","Approximately 6,000 learners annually:":"每年约 6,000 名学习者：","built and led the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery at Manchester Metropolitan University, taking provision from course design through delivery.":"创办并领导 Manchester Metropolitan University 下属 Manchester Institute for Information Delivery，工作涵盖课程设计到实施。","Approximately £1 million annual revenue:":"年收入约 100 万英镑：","built Skillkit Ltd from inception into a business delivering online education and skills programmes.":"从零创办 Skillkit Ltd，使其发展为提供在线教育及技能课程的企业。","Personally designed, accredited courses:":"亲自设计的认证课程：","secured formal Further Education Funding Council accreditation for courses I designed and wrote, enabling access to FEFC funding.":"亲自设计编写的课程获得继续教育资助委员会正式认证，从而能够申请 FEFC 资助。","International collaboration:":"国际合作：","established education and skills-development partnerships across the UK, Spain, Finland and China.":"在英国、西班牙、芬兰和中国建立教育及技能发展合作关系。","What I bring to a learning team.":"我能为学习团队带来什么。","Design grounded in the need.":"基于需求的设计。","I work with business leaders, educators and technical specialists to identify capability gaps, define learning outcomes and build curricula, delivery approaches and assessments around them.":"我与企业领导者、教育工作者和技术专家合作，识别能力差距、明确学习成果，并据此构建课程、教学方法和评估。","Experience across the learning cycle.":"覆盖整个学习周期的经验。","At Skillkit, I managed work from needs analysis and design through LMS/VLE delivery and evaluation. Learner feedback, progress monitoring and performance information informed refinements to content and learner support.":"在 Skillkit，我管理了从需求分析和设计，到通过 LMS/VLE 实施教学及评价的各项工作。学习者反馈、进度监测与表现信息推动内容及学习支持的改进。","Leadership alongside hands-on design.":"领导能力与亲身设计并重。","I have trained and mentored staff, developed people for greater responsibility and brought academic, technical and operational teams together to deliver multidisciplinary programmes.":"我培训并指导员工，帮助他们承担更多责任，并协调学术、技术与运营团队实施跨学科项目。","Accountability for delivery.":"对教学实施负责。","My experience includes government contracts, European funding proposals, budgets, accreditation evidence and formal reporting. At Skillkit, I created client-management systems covering enquiries, learner support and accurate records, producing evidence for UK and European government audits.":"我的经验包括政府合同、欧洲资助申请、预算、认证证据与正式报告。在 Skillkit，我建立客户管理系统，处理咨询、学习支持及准确记录，为英国与欧洲政府审计提供证据。","Career experience.":"职业经历。","Silver Consulting LLC · Owner & Manager · 2014–2026":"Silver Consulting LLC · 所有人兼经理 · 2014—2026","Partnered with senior executives to diagnose organisational needs and translate business objectives into recommendations and implementation plans. Identified capability gaps, coached managers and supported technology adoption, digital capability and process improvement.":"与高管合作诊断组织需求，将业务目标转化为建议及实施计划。识别能力差距、指导管理人员，并支持技术采用、数字能力发展与流程改进。","Skillkit Ltd · Founder & Owner · 1997–2014":"Skillkit Ltd · 创始人兼所有人 · 1997—2014","Built an online education and skills business to approximately £1 million annual revenue. Established online and blended programmes, developed staff, coordinated digital learning projects and managed the practical requirements of funded delivery.":"将在线教育与技能企业发展至年收入约 100 万英镑。建立在线及混合式课程、培养员工、协调数字学习项目，并管理受资助教学的实际要求。","Manchester Institute for Information Delivery · Founder & Director · 1996–2007":"Manchester Institute for Information Delivery · 创始人兼主任 · 1996—2007","Founded and led a university-based institute at Manchester Metropolitan University, recruiting and training approximately 6,000 learners annually. Designed accredited courses, maintained programme records and reporting, and developed international partnerships.":"创办并领导 Manchester Metropolitan University 下属机构，每年招收和培训约 6,000 名学习者。设计认证课程、保存项目记录及报告，并发展国际合作。","Innovation in Digital and Electronic Arts (IDEA) · Founding Chair · 1996–2007":"Innovation in Digital and Electronic Arts（IDEA）· 创始主席 · 1996—2007","Helped establish a not-for-profit organisation whose education and digital-skills programmes trained thousands of participants across the North of England. Worked with education, industry and public-sector partners to develop accessible training for individuals and small businesses.":"协助建立非营利组织，其教育与数字技能课程培训了英格兰北部数千名参与者。与教育、产业及公共部门伙伴合作，为个人和小企业开发易于参与的培训。","SET Ltd · Founder & Owner · 1995–1997":"SET Ltd · 创始人兼所有人 · 1995—1997","Established an online education company, developing learning content and coordinating programmes, resources, participant communication and digital delivery.":"建立在线教育企业，开发学习内容，协调课程、资源、参与者沟通及数字教学。","British Telecom UK · Telecommunications Technician · 1982–1986":"British Telecom UK · 电信技术员 · 1982—1986","Installed digital telecommunications systems and managed small teams, building a practical foundation in fault-finding, technical problem-solving and service delivery.":"安装数字电信系统并管理小团队，积累故障诊断、技术问题解决及服务交付的实践基础。","AI and automation in practice.":"人工智能与自动化实践。","I use ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot and Notion AI to support research, learning design, content development and information analysis. Practical experience with Make and Zapier supports automation, productivity and process improvement. My interest is in responsible adoption: applying technology to the learning or operational need.":"我使用 ChatGPT、Microsoft Copilot 和 Notion AI 支持研究、学习设计、内容开发及信息分析，并运用 Make 和 Zapier 进行自动化、提升效率及改进流程。我关注负责任的技术采用，让技术服务于学习或运营需求。","The portfolio lets you explore my current design work alongside this career experience, including learning activities, teaching resources and the reasoning behind the design.":"作品集让您结合这些职业经验，探索我当前的设计工作，包括学习活动、教学资源及设计背后的理由。","Education and working arrangements.":"教育背景与工作安排。","Manchester Metropolitan University:":"Manchester Metropolitan University：","First-Class Honours Degree in InterActive Arts, specialising in Information Delivery.":"InterActive Arts 一等荣誉学位，专攻 Information Delivery。","Reading Polytechnic:":"Reading Polytechnic：","Higher National Diploma in Electrical Engineering, Telecommunications.":"电气工程与电信高级国家文凭（HND）。","Based in Spain, planning relocation to Manchester and available for remote working.":"目前居住于西班牙，计划搬至曼彻斯特，可远程工作。","02 / Design":"02 / 设计","Turn “what if?” into “try this”.":"把“如果……会怎样？”变成“试试看”。","Give the learner something to predict, investigate and explain. Then make the design decisions visible so the experience can be questioned and improved.":"让学习者能够预测、探究并解释，再呈现设计决策，使体验可以被审视和改进。","Design backwards from the outcome.":"从预期成果反向设计。","I connect the intended outcome to an activity, the support learners need and the evidence that will show understanding. I use":"我将预期成果与活动、所需支持及证明理解的证据联系起来。我运用","ADDIE":"ADDIE","to structure the work while leaving room to revise decisions.":"组织工作，同时保留修订决策的空间。","From “watch this” to “try this”.":"从“看这里”到“试试看”。","The":"这项","stick investigation":"木棒探究活动","moves from prediction to observation and explanation. The":"从预测走向观察与解释。而","university pathway":"大学学习路径","adds a model whose assumptions can be questioned. The learning task makes the reasoning visible, rather than hiding it behind a finished answer.":"增加了一个可以质疑其假设的模型。学习任务呈现推理过程，而不是将其隐藏在最终答案背后。","Build something people can challenge.":"构建可供审视的作品。","I use AI-supported prototyping to make ideas tangible. My role is to shape the learning, question the output and refine the experience. That builds on experience designing":"我借助人工智能制作原型，让想法变得具体。我的职责是塑造学习过程、审视输出并改进体验。这建立在我设计获得以下机构认证的课程经验之上：","-accredited courses and delivering online and blended programmes through Skillkit.":"，以及通过 Skillkit 实施在线与混合式课程的经验。","Explore the design decisions":"探索设计决策","Test":"测试","02 / Explore the design":"02 / 探索设计","Next: see the design in action":"下一步：查看设计实践","Career evidence / 30+ years":"职业经历实证 / 三十余年","Learning design. Built on delivery.":"以教学实施为基础的学习设计。","From founding an education business in 1995 to developing interactive learning today, I connect course design with the realities of running programmes.":"从 1995 年创办教育企业，到如今开发互动学习，我始终将课程设计与项目运营的现实联系起来。","1995–1997 · SET Ltd":"1995—1997 · SET Ltd","I established an online education company, developing learning content and coordinating programmes, resources and digital delivery. I managed participant communication, administration, finances and operations alongside the learning itself.":"我创办在线教育企业，开发内容并协调课程、资源及数字教学，同时管理参与者沟通、行政、财务与运营。","1996–2007 · Manchester Metropolitan University":"1996—2007 · Manchester Metropolitan University","I founded and directed the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery. I translated employer and learner needs into courses with defined outcomes, curricula and assessments, and secured":"我创办并领导 Manchester Institute for Information Delivery，将雇主与学习者需求转化为明确成果、课程结构及评估的课程，并获得","accreditation for courses I personally designed.":"对本人亲自设计课程的认证。","1997–2014 · Skillkit Ltd":"1997—2014 · Skillkit Ltd","I built an online education and skills business to approximately £1 million in annual revenue. My work covered needs analysis, design, delivery and evaluation, supported by learner feedback, progress monitoring and learning management systems.":"我将在线教育与技能企业发展至年收入约 100 万英镑，工作涵盖需求分析、设计、实施与评价，并以学习者反馈、进度监测及学习管理系统提供支持。","2014–2026 · Silver Consulting LLC":"2014—2026 · Silver Consulting LLC","I worked with senior executives to diagnose organisational needs, identify capability gaps and turn priorities into practical plans. I supported technology adoption, management development and process improvement.":"我与高管合作诊断组织需求、识别能力差距，并将优先事项转化为实用计划，支持技术采用、管理人员发展与流程改进。","What that brings to learning design":"这些经验为学习设计带来什么","I consider the whole journey: the learner’s starting point, the intended outcome, the activity, the assessment and the support needed to put learning into practice. Today, I also use AI and automation to support research, content development and prototyping.":"我考虑完整的学习过程：学习者起点、预期成果、活动、评估，以及应用所学所需的支持。如今也运用人工智能与自动化支持研究、内容开发及原型制作。","Drawn from my Training and Learning Manager CV and AI & Digital Learning CV.":"依据我的培训与学习经理简历，以及人工智能与数字学习简历。","FEFC accreditation":"FEFC 认证","You can go directly to the learning project using the button below, or read the project overview that follows below.":"您可以使用下方按钮直接进入学习项目，也可以继续阅读项目介绍。","Open the interactive project":"打开互动学习项目","One investigation. Two learning journeys.":"一项探究，两条学习路径。","A stick is a simple starting point. What learners do with it reveals the design.":"木棒是一个简单的起点，学习者如何使用它，体现了设计。","Explore the learning. Examine the thinking behind it.":"探索学习，审视背后的思考。","How do you turn an everyday object into a worthwhile learning experience? This project starts with a stick and develops two distinct learning pathways: one for 15-year-old school learners, the other for first-year undergraduates. I’ve brought together the lessons, interactive activities, teaching resources and design reasoning so you can explore both the learner experience and the decisions that shape it.":"如何将日常物品转化为有价值的学习体验？本项目从一根木棒出发，为十五岁学生与大学一年级学生设计两条不同路径。我整合课程、互动活动、教学资源与设计说明，让您探索学习体验及塑造体验的决策。","Two audiences. Purposeful differences.":"两个群体，有目的的差异。","The school pathway builds from observation and comparison to prediction, practical investigation and evaluation across four 60-minute lessons. The undergraduate pathway develops modelling, experimental design, measurement, uncertainty and critical analysis across four two-hour sessions. The comparison explains why the curriculum, level of challenge, support and assessment change for each audience.":"学校路径通过四节六十分钟课程，从观察与比较推进到预测、实践探究及评价。大学路径通过四次两小时课程，发展建模、实验设计、测量、不确定度与批判分析能力。比较说明了课程、挑战程度、支持及评估为何随群体而改变。","Learning you can explore for yourself.":"可以亲自探索的学习。","Interactive demonstrations and activities invite learners to investigate, test ideas and explain their reasoning. Move between the two pathways to see how the same starting point can lead to different questions, tasks and expectations—and how the interface supports each group.":"互动演示与活动邀请学习者探究、检验想法并解释推理。切换两条路径，了解相同起点如何带来不同的问题、任务及要求，以及界面如何支持各群体。","Resources for the teacher as well as the learner.":"兼顾教师与学习者的资源。","Detailed teacher packs bring together lesson plans, learning objectives, preparation guidance, worksheets, practical tasks, assessment criteria, model answers and marking rubrics. A teacher dashboard, automatic filling and marking options demonstrate how the product can support the practical work of delivery and assessment alongside the learning activities.":"详细教学包包括教案、学习目标、准备指南、工作表、实践任务、评估标准、参考答案与评分量规。教师面板以及自动填写和评分选项，展示产品如何在学习活动之外支持教学实施与评估。","The reasoning behind the experience.":"体验背后的设计理由。","Explore how I connect curriculum outcomes with activities and evidence of learning, apply ADDIE to examine the design process, and approach differentiation, navigation and accessibility. English, Spanish and Chinese content and speaking guides show how language and presentation form part of the experience. The project also explains where AI supports development and teaching, and where professional judgement remains essential.":"了解我如何将课程成果与活动及学习证据联系起来，运用 ADDIE 审视设计，并处理差异化、导航与无障碍问题。英语、西班牙语与中文内容及语音导览展示语言与呈现方式如何成为体验的一部分。项目也解释人工智能的支持作用，以及专业判断不可替代的领域。","Together, these elements offer a practical view of what I create, why I make particular decisions and how I develop them into a coherent learning product. Start with an activity, inspect a teaching pack or follow the design rationale—the project lets you examine the work from the perspective that interests you most.":"这些内容共同呈现我创造什么、为何作出特定决策，以及如何将决策发展为完整的学习产品。可以从活动开始、查看教学包，或阅读设计理由，从最感兴趣的角度探索作品。","For people hiring learning designers":"面向招聘学习设计师的您","Don’t just":"不只","read my CV.":"阅读我的简历。","Put my thinking":"让我的思考","to work.":"付诸实践。","I’m Jonathan Pincher. I bring":"我是 Jonathan Pincher，拥有","30+ years of experience":"三十余年的经验","turning learner needs into clear courses, practical activities and meaningful assessment—online and blended.":"，将学习需求转化为清晰的课程、实用的活动与有意义的评估，涵盖在线及混合式教学。","what if?":"如果……？","EXPLORE THE DESIGN":"探索设计","ASK A BETTER QUESTION":"提出更好的问题","TRY THE EXPERIENCE":"体验学习","EXPLORE ADDIE":"探索 ADDIE","DESIGN THE EXPERIENCE":"设计体验","TEST AND REFINE":"测试与改进","01 / Question":"01 / 提问","What if the same lesson needs two different designs?":"如果同一节课需要两种不同设计？","A stick. Two learners. Two different starting points. The question is not what content to show—it is what each learner needs to understand and do.":"一根木棒、两类学习者、两个不同起点。关键不是展示什么内容，而是每类学习者需要理解什么、完成什么。","Find the real problem.":"找到真正的问题。","I begin with learners, employers and the context in which learning will be used. I define the required change before choosing content, a platform or an activity.":"我从学习者、雇主及学习应用情境出发，在选择内容、平台或活动之前，先明确需要发生的改变。","One stick. Two very different challenges.":"同一根木棒，两种不同挑战。","In my learning portfolio, a 15-year-old learner observes, predicts and explains. A first-year university learner models, analyses and questions assumptions. The material stays the same; the task changes because the learning need changes.":"在我的学习作品中，十五岁学生观察、预测与解释，大学一年级学生建模、分析并质疑假设。材料保持不变，任务因学习需求不同而改变。","Experience behind the approach.":"方法背后的经验。","At Manchester Metropolitan University, I translated employer and learner needs into courses with defined outcomes, curricula and assessments. The institute I founded recruited and trained approximately 6,000 learners annually.":"在 Manchester Metropolitan University，我将雇主与学习者需求转化为成果、课程结构和评估明确的课程。我创办的机构每年招收并培训约 6,000 名学习者。","Compare the two learning journeys":"比较两条学习路径","01 / Ask a better question":"01 / 提出更好的问题","Next: turn the question into a design":"下一步：将问题转化为设计","03 / Test":"03 / 测试","A polished screen is only the start.":"精致的页面只是开始。","The useful question is what happens when somebody tries to learn with it.":"真正有价值的问题，是人们尝试通过它学习时会发生什么。","Test the task. Then question the result.":"测试任务，再审视结果。","I look at whether instructions make sense, choices lead somewhere useful and feedback helps the learner decide what to do next. A working button proves the interaction works; it does not establish that learning has happened.":"我关注说明是否清晰、选择是否通向有用内容，以及反馈能否帮助学习者决定下一步。按钮可以操作，证明的是交互正常，而非学习已经发生。","Look for the reasoning, not just the answer.":"关注推理，而不只是答案。","In the stick investigation, prediction and explanation offer something to compare. In the university pathway, questioning the model reveals assumptions. These activities create opportunities to examine understanding; their educational impact still needs evaluation with learners.":"木棒探究中的预测与解释提供了比较依据，大学路径中对模型的质疑揭示了假设。这些活动提供审视理解的机会，其教育影响仍需与学习者共同评价。","Use evidence to improve delivery.":"以证据改进教学实施。","At Skillkit, I used learner feedback, progress monitoring and programme information to refine content and learner support. At the university institute, I maintained evidence-based reporting and records for":"在 Skillkit，我运用学习者反馈、进度监测及项目信息改进内容与学习支持。在大学机构，我为以下机构的审计保存基于证据的报告与记录：","and European Social Fund audits. That same discipline informs how I approach this prototype.":"及欧洲社会基金。这种严谨态度也指导我开发本原型。","Explore reflection in the portfolio":"探索作品集中的反思","Career evidence / 6,000":"职业经历实证 / 6,000","Learning at scale. Designed around people.":"以人为本的大规模学习。","At Manchester Metropolitan University, I founded an institute recruiting and training approximately 6,000 learners annually.":"在 Manchester Metropolitan University，我创办的机构每年招收并培训约 6,000 名学习者。","Build the provision. Lead the delivery.":"建设教学项目，领导实施。","As Founder and Director of the Manchester Institute for Information Delivery from 1996 to 2007, I took provision from course design through delivery. I coordinated academic, technical and operational teams, alongside external partners and funding organisations.":"1996—2007 年担任 Manchester Institute for Information Delivery 创始人兼主任期间，我的工作从课程设计延伸到实施，协调学术、技术及运营团队，以及外部合作方和资助机构。","Grow the capacity to deliver":"提升教学实施能力","I grew the department from 2 to 20 employees and annual income from £0 to £600,000. Recruiting, training and mentoring staff helped build the capacity to support programme delivery.":"我将部门从 2 名员工发展到 20 名，年收入从零增长至 60 万英镑。通过招聘、培训和指导，建立支撑课程实施的能力。","Make the learning accountable":"让学习实施可核查、可负责","I assessed programme requirements and translated them into structured courses and delivery plans. I maintained detailed records of learner support time and outcomes, with evidence-based reporting for":"我评估项目要求，将其转化为结构化课程和实施计划，保存学习支持时间及结果的详细记录，并为以下机构的审计提供证据报告：","and European Social Fund audits.":"及欧洲社会基金。","Work across boundaries":"跨越边界的合作","I established partnerships across the UK, Spain, Finland and China, bringing educators, technical specialists and partners together around education and skills development.":"我在英国、西班牙、芬兰与中国建立合作关系，围绕教育与技能发展汇聚教育工作者、技术专家及伙伴。","What the figure means":"这个数字意味着什么","The approximately 6,000 figure describes annual learner recruitment and training at the institute during my leadership. It is a measure of provision, rather than a claim about completion rates or measured learning gains.":"约 6,000 人指我领导机构期间每年招收和培训的学习者人数，衡量的是教学规模，而非完成率或已测量的学习成效。","Breadcrumb":"面包屑导航","Career evidence":"职业经历实证","Continue exploring":"继续探索","Explore the ADDIE framework":"探索 ADDIE 框架","FEFC archived homepage":"FEFC 首页存档","From a question to a learning experience":"从问题到学习体验","Main portfolio navigation":"作品集主导航","Portfolio navigation":"作品集导航","Read how I design learning experiences":"了解我如何设计学习体验","Read how I test and refine the work":"了解我如何测试与改进作品","Related career evidence":"相关职业经历实证","What if? Turn the question into a learning experience":"如果……？将问题转化为学习体验","Choose language":"选择语言","Put my thinking to work | Jonathan Pincher":"让我的思考发挥作用 | Jonathan Pincher","Jonathan Pincher: instructional design, working learning experiences and evidence from 30+ years of delivery.":"Jonathan Pincher：教学设计、可操作的学习体验，以及 30 多年教学实践的证据。"}};
const controls=document.querySelector('.portfolio-language-switch');
const skip=node=>node.parentElement.closest('script,style,.portfolio-language-switch');
const walker=document.createTreeWalker(document.body,NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT);const nodes=[];
while(walker.nextNode()){const node=walker.currentNode;if(!skip(node)&&node.nodeValue.trim())nodes.push({node,original:node.nodeValue,key:node.nodeValue.trim()});}
const attributes=[];for(const el of document.querySelectorAll('[aria-label],[title],[alt],[placeholder]')){if(el.closest('.portfolio-language-switch'))continue;for(const name of ['aria-label','title','alt','placeholder']){if(el.hasAttribute(name))attributes.push({el,name,key:el.getAttribute(name)});}}
const title=document.title;const valid=lang=>['en','es','zh'].includes(lang);let current='en';
function apply(lang){if(!valid(lang))lang='en';current=lang;const d=dictionaries[lang]||{};
for(const entry of nodes){const value=d[entry.key];entry.node.nodeValue=value===undefined?entry.original:entry.original.replace(entry.key,value);}
for(const entry of attributes){entry.el.setAttribute(entry.name,d[entry.key]||entry.key);}
document.documentElement.lang=lang==='zh'?'zh-CN':lang;
const heading=document.querySelector('main h1');document.title=lang==='en'?title:(d[title]||(heading?heading.textContent.trim()+' | Jonathan Pincher':title));
const description=document.querySelector('meta[name="description"]');if(description){const original=description.dataset.portfolioOriginal||(description.dataset.portfolioOriginal=description.content);description.content=lang==='en'?original:(d[original]||original);}
for(const button of controls.querySelectorAll('[data-language]'))button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(button.dataset.language===lang));

controls.querySelector('.portfolio-language-options').setAttribute('aria-label',{en:'Choose language',es:'Elegir idioma',zh:'选择语言'}[lang]);
try{localStorage.setItem('portfolio-language',lang);localStorage.setItem('jp-guide-language',lang);localStorage.setItem('jp-portfolio-language',lang);}catch{}
try{const url=new URL(location.href);url.searchParams.set('lang',lang);history.replaceState(null,'',url);}catch{}
for(const a of document.querySelectorAll('a[href]')){const raw=a.getAttribute('href');if(/^[^:#?]+\.html(?:[?#]|$)/.test(raw)){const u=new URL(raw,location.href);if(u.origin===location.origin){u.searchParams.set('lang',lang);a.setAttribute('href',u.pathname.split('/').pop()+u.search+u.hash);}}}
window.dispatchEvent(new Event('resize'));
}
window.JP_PORTFOLIO_LANGUAGE={apply};
addEventListener('pageshow',()=>{try{const language=localStorage.getItem('jp-guide-language')||localStorage.getItem('portfolio-language');if(valid(language)&&language!==current)apply(language)}catch{}});
controls.addEventListener('click',event=>{const button=event.target.closest('[data-language]');if(!button)return;apply(button.dataset.language);button.focus();});

let initial=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('lang');if(!valid(initial)){try{initial=localStorage.getItem('jp-guide-language')||localStorage.getItem('portfolio-language');}catch{}}
apply(valid(initial)?initial:'en');
})();